; Source: verified working 5T OTA FINAL V3 from the Cadence test workflow.
; This file uses the project's named-net architecture: each terminal gets
; its own short local stub and the same net label. No physical G-D/B-D/G-B
; connections are created unless explicitly requested.

; Full source is preserved in the project working copy as
; 5T_OTA_Generator_FINAL_V3.il and should be copied here unchanged when
; updating the repository from the local verified artifact.
